        "note": "a tracking key of 2 400 bytes -- the EXPANDED dk, which \u00a71 forbids as the representation; the 64-byte (d, z) seed is what makes the delegated object 64 bytes and not 2 400. Also: splitting the 96 bytes as 64 || 32"
